---
import Icon from "./Icon.jsx";
const milestones = [
  ["An open invitation", "A status post invited an honest, judgement-free conversation about mental health."],
  ["A community formed", "The conversation grew into regular virtual and in-person support."],
  ["The work expanded", "TTNGH became a registered NGO in Tema, delivering counselling, education and outreach."],
];
---
<section id="story" class="story-section" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="story-layout">
    <figure class="story-visual"><img src="/images/refresh/vision-listening-960.webp" srcset="/images/refresh/vision-listening-640.webp 640w, /images/refresh/vision-listening-960.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 45vw" alt="Participants seated together and listening at Vision with Clarity" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Vision with Clarity · TTNGH</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="story-copy"><h2 id="story-title">It began with a conversation.</h2><p>In July 2023, a judgement-free conversation about mental health became the beginning of The Thriving Network GH.</p><ol class="story-progress">{milestones.map(([title, text], index) => <li><span aria-hidden="true">0{index + 1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></li>)}</ol><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/ttngh-company-profile-2026.pdf" download>Read the company profile <Icon name="arrow-right" /></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="story-beliefs"><article class="story-belief"><h3>Our vision</h3><p>A stigma-free society where mental health is embraced as an essential part of overall well-being.</p></article><article class="story-belief"><h3>Our mission</h3><p>Eradicate stigma through education, advocacy, and support so people can seek help without fear.</p></article></div>
</section>
